{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "01ec1de2-f0ee-8827-9920-9b45da8a1467",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:52:52-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:48:44-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:48:49-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I am calling about a pothole. It is at the corner near my mother's house, and it is the same hole again. They patch it, and it opens again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:03-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get some details. Where's the corner? What's the address you're near?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:10-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is twelve Bacheller Street. That is my mother's house, I am calling for her. The hole is at the intersection right by there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:21-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twelve Bacheller, Fifth Ward. Got it. And you said it's been patched before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:28-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three times. Three. Somebody comes, they put the black stuff, maybe two weeks, and then it is open again. After the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago, it is worse. [pause] Sorry, one second, I am checking something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:49:49-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry. I am baking sourdough right now and I have to look at the dough every few minutes. It is rising too fast, the kitchen is warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:02-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. So how big are we talking on the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:08-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across. Maybe a little more on one side. Cars go around it into the other lane, so it is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:19-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, repeated patching, at the intersection by twelve Bacheller. Writing that down. Any idea how deep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:28-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep enough that my mother's tire hit it and the car made a bad noise. I would say like a hand, maybe six inches. I don't know the word, what do you say, the edges are crumbling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:45-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, crumbling works. Sounds like the patch just isn't holding because of the water getting under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:50:53-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So what I want is, please put the street on the repair list. A real repair, not just a patch. Every time it is the cold patch and it goes away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:51:07-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can add it to the list and flag it as a repeat. I can't tell you the date a crew gets there, but it'll be on the list with the note that it's been patched three times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:51:24-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What does it mean, on the list? Like, is it a week, a month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:51:31-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It just means it's logged for the crews to schedule. After a wet stretch like this there's a lot of them, so it depends on the queue. I'd say it's weeks more than days, but I don't have an exact date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:51:50-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It is a little annoying, because I already called one time before, I think. Or my mother did. Anyway. Please just write it clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:02-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll write it clear. Bacheller Street intersection, pothole about two feet across, patched three times, reopening, request for permanent repair. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:15-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is four zero one, five five five, zero one five one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:22-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-one. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:26-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wilson Tavares. T-A-V-A-R-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:28-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Wilson. I've got you down as calling for your mom at twelve Bacheller. Anything else on that street while I've got you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:39-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just the hole. [pause] Okay, I have to go, the dough, it is going to over-proof. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:52:48-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go save your bread. Thanks for calling, Wilson."
    }
  ],
